      "writtenOn": "2014-11-20T21:35:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is already a case a few lines below (~ line 4256) where it has been detected that the path has changed [as in OTA], and privilege is explicitly applied when appropriate:\n\n  if (locationIsPrivileged(scanFile)) {\n    updatedPkg.pkgFlags |\u003d ApplicationInfo.FLAG_PRIVILEGED;\n  }\n\nI would think the correction in the other direction would best be done as an \u0027else\u0027 clause here:\n\n  if (locationIsPrivileged(scanFile)) {\n    updatedPkg.pkgFlags |\u003d ApplicationInfo.FLAG_PRIVILEGED;\n  } else {\n    // A formerly-privileged apk has been moved out of privilege; revoke it\n    updatedPkg.pkgFlags \u0026\u003d ~ApplicationInfo.FLAG_PRIVILEGED;\n  }\n\nI\u0027m wary of introducing another privilege-adjustment point outside the scope of the existing \"app whose system path has changed due to OTA\" sequence.",
